先化简根号内的幂：\[3^{-\frac32}\left( \frac13 \right)^{-3}=3^{-\frac32}3^3=3^{\frac32}\]因此\[\frac{\sqrt[3]{3^{-\frac32}\left( \frac13 \right)^{-3}}}{\left( \sqrt3-1 \right)^2}
=\frac{3^{\frac12}}{\left( \sqrt3-1 \right)^2}
=\frac{\sqrt3}{4-2\sqrt3}
=\frac{\sqrt3}{2\left( 2-\sqrt3 \right)}\]分母有理化，得\[\frac{\sqrt3}{2\left( 2-\sqrt3 \right)}
=\frac{\sqrt3\left( 2+\sqrt3 \right)}{2\left( 2-\sqrt3 \right)\left( 2+\sqrt3 \right)}
=\frac{2\sqrt3+3}{2}\]

